
Package: haamR
Title: Hybrid Abbas Ali Metric for Mixed-Type Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Abbas", "Ali", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides an experimental distance metric for datasets
    containing mixed numerical and categorical variables. Designed
    for exploring similarity between observations with different
    data types.
